<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Open now the crystal fountain,</l><l>Whence the healing waters flow;</l><l>Let the fiery, cloudy pillar</l><l>Lead me all my journey through;</l><l>Strong Deliv’rer,</l><l>Be Thou still my strength and shield;</l><l>Strong Deliv’rer,</l><l>Be Thou still my strength and shield.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
